window.RTLBenchLSData.register("assets/d301294e54b5fee329e7c61c50cbc44328e01dd554217c3687ec9af00f475405.txt","This module is a 64-bit register with synchronous load functionality. It has four ports: a clock input (clk), a load enable input (ld), a 64-bit data input (d), and a 64-bit data output (q). On the rising edge of the clock, if the load enable (ld) is active, the register captures the input data (d) and updates the output (q) accordingly. The output retains its value if the load enable is inactive.");
